This repository (github.com/2200176074/dsh-purge) is a community
continuation of version 1.1.92. Modifications relative to upstream:

  1. Patches #12 and #74 gained pattern variants for DSH 0.2.2-rc.1;
     all original patterns remain in place for 0.2.1 compatibility.
  2. Version renumbered 1.1.92 -> 1.1.93; dshTargets extended with 0.2.2-rc.1.
  3. Removed the dsh.install metadata block (all three URLs pointed at the
     deleted repository) and .github/workflows/release.yml (depended on
     secrets from that repository).
  4. README rewritten for this fork.

These modifications are not affiliated with, nor endorsed by, the original
maintainers.

